[{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0656","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0656.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57975","title":"Linux Kernel Btrfs 内存页清理不当导致拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 btrfs 文件系统在 `run_delalloc_nocow()` 函数处理延迟分配写入失败时存在 folio（页缓存）清理缺陷。当预分配区段的 NOCOW 写入成功但后续 COW 写入因空间不足失败时，错误处理路径未正确清除 folio 脏标志并解锁，导致内核触发 VM_BUG_ON_FOLIO 断言崩溃。本地低权限攻击者可通过构造特定 btrfs 文件系统操作（如触发 cow_file_range 返回 -ENOSPC）引发拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 btrfs 模块，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57975"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-27T02:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:21Z","remediation":"立即将 Linux 内核升级至 6.12.13、6.13.2 或 6.14 及以上版本（对应修复 commit：5ae72abbf91eb、2434533f1c963、c2b47df81c8e2）。Ubuntu 22.04 LTS 用户请安装 USN-7653-1 安全更新：sudo apt update && sudo apt install linux-image-generic。如无法立即升级内核，可临时禁用 btrfs 文件系统的预分配（prealloc）功能作为缓解措施，但建议优先安排内核热重启完成升级。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2434533f1c963e7317c45880c98287e5bed98325","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/5ae72abbf91eb172ce3a838a4dc34be3c9707296","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c2b47df81c8e20a8e8cd94f0d7df211137ae94ed","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57975.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-57975","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57975.yaml","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/027c37e8e73e99b2a68cafab2e6594bde5db273e/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57975.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2024-57975.md","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-57975-btrfs-do-proper-folio-cleanup-when--1771405538000.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/050b62cac636d83be07e6d4c77e70114e1ca7c93/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-57975.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-57975.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2025/02/GHSA-wp4j-4pcv-wwf5/GHSA-wp4j-4pcv-wwf5.json","https://github.com/GingaShift/Anssi-Vulnerability-Intelligence/blob/5e1cffb341ca5a500e965d4cda39bf8603e2ff16/data/offline_prof/first/CVE-2024-57975"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0656.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0655","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0655.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57974","title":"Linux Kernel UDP 套接字地址变更与重哈希竞争条件漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 UDP 协议栈存在条件竞争漏洞。当 UDP socket 通过 connect() 更改本地地址时，在地址变更完成但哈希表（包括二次哈希和四元组哈希）尚未更新的时间窗口内，查找操作可能无法找到该 socket，导致后续数据报无法送达。攻击者可通过在目标系统上构造并发 UDP 通信场景触发此竞态条件，造成 UDP 数据包丢失并触发 ICMP 端口不可达错误，最终导致拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核多个版本，CVSS 评分 4.7，危害等级中危。Linux 内核社区已通过合入补丁修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.7,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57974"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-27T02:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:14:21Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.12.13、6.13.2 或 6.14 及以上版本，其中已合入 udp rehash 竞态修复补丁。对于无法立即升级的系统，可限制 UDP 应用使用 connect() 绑定地址的场景，或通过内核实时补丁 (kpatch/kgraft) 加载修复补丁作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4f8344fce91c5766d368edb0ad80142eacd805c7","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a502ea6fa94b1f7be72a24bcf9e3f5f6b7e6e90c","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d65d3bf309b2649d27b24efd0d8784da2d81f2a6","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57974.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57974","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57974.yaml","https://github.com/openharmony/security/blob/f47b282130050082f1bcf6813aaced4157bd1771/vulntest/SSTSTestcases/2025/09/CVE-2024-57974/TestCaseRule-CVE-2024-57974.yara","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/027c37e8e73e99b2a68cafab2e6594bde5db273e/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57974.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/c54e59752dddfc9aa36c13774164384cfa0d1f04/content/CVE-2024-57974.md","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/01/08/seguranca/cve-2024-57974-udp-deal-with-race-between-udp-sock-1767883606000.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/050b62cac636d83be07e6d4c77e70114e1ca7c93/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-57974.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2025/02/GHSA-hqjf-7m9j-v4qc/GHSA-hqjf-7m9j-v4qc.json","https://github.com/MatALass/anssi-vulnerability-intelligence/blob/77a0771d93df03375a6a04965087efb0123e795f/data/raw/anssi_snapshot/first/CVE-2024-57974"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0655.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0654","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0654.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57973","title":"Linux Kernel RDMA cxgb4 驱动整数溢出漏洞","description":"Linux 内核中 RDMA/CXGB4 驱动存在整数溢出漏洞，在 32 位系统上，攻击者可通过 process_responses() 接口控制 gl->tot_len 变量，当将其与 sizeof(struct cpl_pass_accept_req) 及 sizeof(struct rss_header) 相加时可能触发整数回绕，导致内核内存破坏。本地低权限攻击者可利用该漏洞造成系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 rdma/cxgb4 驱动相关版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57973"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-27T02:15:10Z","updated":"2026-07-14T13:17:14Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至以下已修复版本：5.4.291、5.10.235、5.15.179、6.1.129、6.6.76、6.12.13 或 6.13.2 及以上。对于无法立即升级的系统，可限制本地用户对 RDMA cxgb4 设备的访问权限，或通过内核模块黑名单禁用 cxgb4 驱动（/etc/modprobe.d/blacklist-cxgb4.conf 中添加 blacklist cxgb4）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2b759f78b83221f4a1cae3aeb20b500e375f3ee6","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4422f452d028850b9cc4fd8f1cf45a8ff91855eb","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/aeb814484387811b3579d5c78ad4eb301e3bf1c8","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/bd96a3935e89486304461a21752f824fc25e0f0b","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d64148a10a85952352de6091ceed99fb9ce2d3ee","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/dd352107f22bfbecbbf3b74bde14f3f932296309","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/de8d88b68d0cfd41152a7a63d6aec0ed3e1b837a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/e53ca458f543aa352d09b484550de173cb9085c2","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00028.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/05/msg00030.html","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-019113.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2024/CVE-2024-57973.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57973.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57973.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57973","https://github.com/HerringLiu2333/Analysis-of-CWE/blob/cd8202c32037ed388ecd79e1fc81394f13c4d4a4/CVE-2024-57973/CVE-2024-57973.ql","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/acf4fca32ae3e6d7d43276d798ba52a241ef3b49/2024/CVE-2024-57973.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/027c37e8e73e99b2a68cafab2e6594bde5db273e/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57973.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/31d5b78ee7ad856a6aee490403faecefdc8a4878/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57973-2025-11-03-1359","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/050b62cac636d83be07e6d4c77e70114e1ca7c93/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-57973.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-57973-rdmacxgb4-prevent-potential-integer-1771408115000.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0654.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0671","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0671.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-58005","title":"Linux Kernel TPM 事件日志内存分配漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 TPM（可信平台模块）子系统的 eventlog/acpi.c 文件中存在内存分配缺陷，原代码使用常规内存分配函数处理 ACPI 平台事件日志，当处理大块内存时可能导致分配失败，进而引发内核信息泄露或拒绝服务。该漏洞影响使用 Linux 内核 TPM 模块的系统，攻击者可通过本地触发特定 ACPI 事件日志操作，利用不恰当的内存分配机制造成内核内存访问异常。Red Hat 将该漏洞评为 Moderate 危害等级。Linux 内核社区已通过改用 kvalloc() 函数修复此问题，该函数支持大内存分配并自动回退到 vmalloc 机制。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2024-58005"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-27T00:00:00Z","updated":"2025-02-27T00:00:00Z","remediation":"立即将 Linux 内核升级至 6.13.3、6.12.14 或 6.6.78 及以上版本；使用长期支持分支（5.10/5.15/6.1）的用户应升级至 5.10.235、5.15.179 或 6.1.130 及以上版本。Siemens SIMATIC S7-1500 MFP 用户请参考 Siemens 安全公告 SSA-503939 更新固件。如无法立即升级内核，可通过限制本地用户对 TPM 设备的访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2024/CVE-2024-58005.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/15ba52d0829fe2220e9f89276b2743c7eef0ab2a/cves/2024/58xxx/CVE-2024-58005.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-58005.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-58005","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/acf4fca32ae3e6d7d43276d798ba52a241ef3b49/2024/CVE-2024-58005.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/027c37e8e73e99b2a68cafab2e6594bde5db273e/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-58005.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/31d5b78ee7ad856a6aee490403faecefdc8a4878/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-58005-2025-11-03-1326","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/648427aa2db027c1629d5ac1fafa487d8d68e08f/CVE/data/2024/CVE-2024-58005.json","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-58005-tpm-change-to-kvalloc-in-eventlogac-1771407157000.md","https://github.com/krafthack-by-techday/Night-s-watch/blob/30ae1bcc335306fe4c5507b2c629cae4932e515e/cve/siemens/CVE-2024-58005_SSA-503939.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0671.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0660","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0660.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57979","title":"Linux 内核 PPS 子系统释放后使用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 PPS（Pulse Per Second，脉冲每秒）子系统中存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞。由于在 PPS 设备操作过程中对并发访问的处理不当，当多个线程同时访问或释放 PPS 设备时，可能导致已释放的内存被继续使用，进而引发内核崩溃或权限提升。本地攻击者可通过特制的系统调用序列触发此漏洞，实现对受影响系统的拒绝服务或潜在提权攻击。该漏洞影响多个 Linux 发行版，包括 SUSE Linux Enterprise 15、Ubuntu 18.04/22.04 LTS、Debian 11、Amazon Linux 及 EulerOS 等。各发行版已发布安全更新修复此漏洞，建议用户及时升级内核至修复版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57979"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-27T00:00:00Z","updated":"2025-02-27T00:00:00Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Linux 内核至以下修复版本：5.4.291+、5.10.235+、5.15.179+、6.1.129+、6.6.76+、6.12.13+ 或 6.13.2+。各发行版用户请参照对应安全公告安装更新：Debian 用户参考 DLA-4102-1/DLA-4178-1，Ubuntu 用户参考 USN-7540-1/USN-7511-1，SUSE 用户参考 SUSE-SU-2025:0847-1，Amazon Linux 用户参考 ALAS2KERNEL-5.10-2025-088。如无法立即升级，可通过限制本地用户对 PPS 设备的访问权限作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/e69d88e0152845fc4d4b49970ca6e503f56b2f93/2024/CVE-2024-57979.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50b2026c1039c6a81b95d80535c772b9d8685178/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57979.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2024-57979","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2024/CVE-2024-57979.yaml","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/acf4fca32ae3e6d7d43276d798ba52a241ef3b49/2024/CVE-2024-57979.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/9553fde5ed5ff45a613d88bc99087dbba2111555/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57979.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/027c37e8e73e99b2a68cafab2e6594bde5db273e/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-57979.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/31d5b78ee7ad856a6aee490403faecefdc8a4878/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57979-2025-11-03-1359","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/fa1c2f93b0d15da115c038738e571c1a1553b4cc/advisories/unreviewed/2025/02/GHSA-579q-3q2m-34fw/GHSA-579q-3q2m-34fw.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2024-57979"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0660.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0553","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0553.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-53427","title":"jq 栈缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"jq 命令行 JSON 处理工具 1.7.1 及之前版本的 decNumber.c 中的 decNumberCopy 函数存在类型混淆漏洞（CWE-843），未正确区分 NaN（非数值）与普通数值类型，导致栈缓冲区溢出和越界写入。攻击者可通过构造包含特定 NaN 数字字符串（如 \"1 NaN123\" 后跟大量数字）的 JSON 输入，配合 --slurp 参数使用减法过滤器（如 .-.）触发该漏洞，造成拒绝服务或潜在的信息泄露。该漏洞需本地访问且利用复杂度较高，CVSS 评分 8.1，影响所有使用 jq 1.7.1 及之前版本的系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.1,"aliases":["CVE-2024-53427"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-26T16:15:16Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:08:52Z","remediation":"立即将 jq 升级至 1.8.0 及以上版本（当前最新为 1.8.2），该版本已合入拒绝解析带载荷 NaN（如 NaN123）的修复补丁。可通过包管理器更新（如 apt install jq=1.8.2、brew upgrade jq）或从 https://github.com/jqlang/jq/releases 下载最新二进制替换。如无法升级，可在输入 JSON 前通过预处理过滤包含 NaN 后跟数字的字符串作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://gist.github.com/Ekkosun/a83870ce7f3b7813b9b462a395e8ad92","https://github.com/jqlang/jq/blob/71c2ab509a8628dbbad4bc7b3f98a64aa90d3297/src/decNumber/decNumber.c#L3375","https://github.com/jqlang/jq/issues/3196","https://github.com/jqlang/jq/issues/3296","https://github.com/jqlang/jq/security/advisories/GHSA-x6c3-qv5r-7q22","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-53427.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2024/53xxx/CVE-2024-53427.json","https://github.com/jqlang/jq/blob/2d410d6d86be7f685ad28e5cffac0248aa47664c/NEWS.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/bd141078a7ff2a16f9bd8cc62066eb74bbd40e0e/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-53427.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-53427","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/40201653244e9d985cea536a2ac651eca18f5fd4/2024/53xxx/CVE-2024-53427.json","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/6ca8a69233790aa99633b6ad5606668ac000cf96/main/jq/APKBUILD","https://github.com/Xilinx/meta-openembedded/blob/4d3e2639dec542b58708244662d5ce36810fc510/meta-oe/recipes-devtools/jq/jq/CVE-2024-53427.patch","https://github.com/hashicorp/hcp/blob/22914bf04188992bd99f6dea82da226d9204f62b/.release/security-scan.hcl","https://github.com/wolfi-dev/os/blob/4b5161978d759ef78f9196705942bfe3008611db/jq.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0553.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0517","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0517.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-45777","title":"GNU GRUB2 gettext 整数溢出导致堆越界写入漏洞","description":"GRUB2 的 gettext 国际化模块在处理语言 .mo 文件时存在整数溢出漏洞。函数 grub_gettext_getstr_from_position() 在计算翻译缓冲区大小时未正确校验，导致整数溢出后分配过小的堆缓冲区，进而引发堆越界写入。具有高权限的本地攻击者可通过挂载包含特制 .mo 语言文件的文件系统，在系统启动过程中触发该漏洞，覆盖 GRUB2 堆中的敏感数据，最终绕过 Secure Boot 安全启动保护机制。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响的 GRUB2 版本的 Linux 发行版，CVSS 评分 6.7，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.7,"aliases":["CVE-2024-45777"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-19T18:15:23Z","updated":"2026-06-29T23:16:41Z","remediation":"立即将 grub2 升级至包含该修复的版本（上游 commit b970a5ed967816bbca8225994cd0ee2557bad515）。各发行版对应：Red Hat 系安装 RHSA 安全更新，Debian/Ubuntu 运行 `apt update && apt upgrade grub-pc grub-efi`，更新后执行 `update-grub` 并重启。如无法立即升级，可限制仅受信任用户拥有物理访问权限和 root 权限以缓解利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2025:20532","https://access.redhat.com/security/cve/CVE-2024-45777","https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=2346343","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/377bb49f7479dd297ab5004f75a37c291a136578/cves/2024/45xxx/CVE-2024-45777.json","https://github.com/open-edge-platform/edge-microvisor-toolkit/blob/84e7ae47f14035508805838ccc3a113644857e14/SPECS/grub2/CVE-2024-45777.patch","https://github.com/NixOS/nixpkgs/blob/e8893979ed5a1de12f167238f69085e8e620c963/pkgs/by-name/gr/grub2/package.nix","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2726c8e981acc1c694a4bf2f24fcc9360825f783/2024/45xxx/CVE-2024-45777.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-45777","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/4cbc1cd445b97bc2235c2b80e223e324747c59b3/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-45777.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2024-45777.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2024-45777.json","https://github.com/rhboot/shim-review/blob/189497d59fa34f4dd88ea1bcfa6e54e7581acae8/README.md","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-45777.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0517.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0597","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0597.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57259","title":"DENX Das U-Boot Squashfs 目录列表越界写入漏洞","description":"Das U-Boot 中的 sqfs_search_dir 函数存在差一错误（off-by-one）漏洞，由于在计算 squashfs 目录列表大小时未考虑路径分隔符，导致堆内存损坏。物理接触目标设备的攻击者可通过构造特制的 squashfs 镜像文件系统，在系统启动过程中触发该漏洞，可能导致拒绝服务或潜在的内存数据破坏。该漏洞影响 2025.01-rc1 之前的所有 Das U-Boot 版本，CVSS 评分 7.1，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57259"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-18T23:15:09Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:13:28Z","remediation":"升级 U-Boot 至 2025.01-rc1 及以上版本（上游 commit 048d795bb5b3d9c5701b4855f5e74bcf6849bf5e）。Debian 用户：bullseye 升级至 2021.01+dfsg-5+deb11u3，bookworm 升级至 2023.01+dfsg-2+deb12u3。如无法升级，在 squashfs 文件系统挂载前禁用 squashfs 目录遍历功能，或避免使用 squashfs 格式的启动镜像。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://source.denx.de/u-boot/u-boot/-/commit/048d795bb5b3d9c5701b4855f5e74bcf6849bf5e","https://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/02/17/2","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/05/msg00001.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57259.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57259.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57259.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-57259","https://github.com/Xilinx/poky/blob/1d54d1c4736a114e1cecbe85a0306e3814d5ce70/meta/recipes-bsp/u-boot/files/CVE-2024-57259.patch","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/75471602a53215062ddbaeb95f039a60b664c3d0/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-57259.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/d8c79a157e22e9abda84461cbe0f59ce58612245/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57259-2025-11-03-1351","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/c6c9e305761264e104c5de70e59376c519bbfef3/2024/CVE-2024-57259.md","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-57259-sqfs-search-dir-in-das-u-boot-befor-1771411984000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2025/02/GHSA-c2cp-78ww-6jm8/GHSA-c2cp-78ww-6jm8.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0597.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0596","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0596.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57258","title":"DENX Das U-Boot 内存分配整数溢出漏洞","description":"Das U-Boot 引导加载程序在 2025.01-rc1 之前版本中存在整数溢出漏洞，源于对精心构造的 squashfs 文件系统进行内存分配时，通过 sbrk、request2size 或 x86_64 架构上 ptrdiff_t 处理不当触发。攻击者需物理接触目标设备并挂载恶意 squashfs 镜像，利用该漏洞可导致内存越界写入，进而实现任意代码执行或系统崩溃。该漏洞影响广泛使用 U-Boot 的嵌入式设备、物联网终端及开发板，CVSS 评分 7.1，危害等级高。厂商已在 2025.01-rc1 版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57258"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-18T23:15:09Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:13:28Z","remediation":"升级 Das U-Boot 到 2025.01-rc1 或更高版本。Debian 11 用户请安装 DLA-4150 安全更新（`apt install u-boot`），SUSE Linux 用户请安装 SUSE-SU-2025:0989-1 更新。如无法立即升级，避免加载来源不可信的 squashfs 文件系统镜像，并限制物理访问以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://source.denx.de/u-boot/u-boot/-/commit/0a10b49206a29b4aa2f80233a3e53ca0466bb0b3","https://source.denx.de/u-boot/u-boot/-/commit/8642b2178d2c4002c99a0b69a845a48f2ae2706f","https://source.denx.de/u-boot/u-boot/-/commit/c17b2a05dd50a3ba437e6373093a0d6a359cdee0","https://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/02/17/2","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/05/msg00001.html","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-577017.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57258.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57258.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-57258","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/75471602a53215062ddbaeb95f039a60b664c3d0/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-57258.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57258.json","https://github.com/ocp-hm-openbmc-opf-ami/meta-ami/blob/5f689b55d58747fe911d565fdb321768aed35a0b/meta-common/recipes-bsp/u-boot/files/CVE-2024-57258.patch","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/d8c79a157e22e9abda84461cbe0f59ce58612245/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57258-2025-11-03-1351","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-57258.md","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-57258.html","https://github.com/moyamartin/meta-rpi-mmoya/blob/503560d3dcf3bf87d8e93ed59f202e9120db397b/recipes-bsp/u-boot/files/CVE-2024-57258-1.patch"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0596.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0595","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0595.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57257","title":"DENX Das U-Boot squashfs 文件系统栈消耗拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Das U-Boot 的 SquashFS 文件系统实现中的 sqfs_size 函数存在栈消耗漏洞（CWE-674），由于在处理符号链接时未限制递归深度，攻击者可通过向目标设备加载包含深度嵌套符号链接的恶意 SquashFS 文件系统镜像，触发无限递归导致栈溢出，造成系统拒绝服务。该漏洞需要物理接触目标设备才能利用，影响 U-Boot 2025.01-rc1 之前的所有版本。","severity":"LOW","score":2.0,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57257"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-18T23:15:09Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:13:28Z","remediation":"升级 U-Boot 至 2025.01 或更高版本（该漏洞在 2025.01-rc1 之前存在）。Debian 11 用户请执行 `apt-get update && apt-get upgrade u-boot` 安装 DLA-4150-1 安全更新。若无法升级，可在加载 squashfs 文件系统前校验其来源可信性，避免加载包含深层符号链接嵌套的恶意 squashfs 镜像。嵌入式设备用户应同步更新厂商提供的 U-Boot 补丁包。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://source.denx.de/u-boot/u-boot/-/commit/4f5cc096bfd0a591f8a11e86999e3d90a9484c34","https://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/02/17/2","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/05/msg00001.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57257.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57257.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57257.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-57257","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/75471602a53215062ddbaeb95f039a60b664c3d0/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-57257.json","https://github.com/Xilinx/poky/blob/1d54d1c4736a114e1cecbe85a0306e3814d5ce70/meta/recipes-bsp/u-boot/files/CVE-2024-57257.patch","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/d8c79a157e22e9abda84461cbe0f59ce58612245/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57257-2025-11-03-1351","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-57257-a-stack-consumption-issue-in-sqfs-s-1771412242000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2025/02/GHSA-8h8c-f86r-pf3c/GHSA-8h8c-f86r-pf3c.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/active/CVE-2024-57257"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0595.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0594","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0594.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57256","title":"Das U-Boot 整数溢出漏洞","description":"Das U-Boot 在 2025.01-rc1 之前的版本中存在整数溢出漏洞，具体位于 ext4fs_read_symlink 函数。当处理 ext4 文件系统符号链接时，函数对一个 le32 变量执行加一操作（zalloc 分配）时发生整数溢出，导致 malloc 分配零字节内存，进而引发内存覆写。攻击者可通过构造包含恶意 inode 大小（0xffffffff）的 ext4 文件系统镜像，使设备在引导过程中触发该漏洞，实现任意代码执行或拒绝服务。该漏洞影响所有使用 U-Boot 引导加载程序的嵌入式设备和开发板，CVSS 评分 7.1（高危），攻击需物理接触或本地访问。修复方案为升级至 U-Boot 2025.01-rc1 或更高版本，厂商已提供补丁修复此整数溢出问题。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57256"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-18T23:15:09Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:13:28Z","remediation":"立即升级 Das U-Boot 至 2025.01-rc1 或更高稳定版本（建议 2025.01 正式发布版）。编译升级流程：从 U-Boot 官方仓库（https://source.denx.de/u-boot/u-boot）克隆代码，切换至 v2025.01 标签，执行 `make <板型>_defconfig && make` 编译后刷写固件。若无法立即升级，可从上游获取 CVE-2024-57256 补丁（https://github.com/ocp-hm-openbmc-opf-ami/meta-ami 已收录该补丁文件），应用 `ext4fs_read_symlink` 函数中的 zalloc 大小校验修复，对 le32 变量加 1 前检查是否溢出。同时，限制设备从不可信 USB 存储设备启动，避免挂载来源不明的 ext4 分区，降低触发整数溢出的攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://source.denx.de/u-boot/u-boot/-/commit/35f75d2a46e5859138c83a75cd2f4141c5479ab9","https://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/02/17/2","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/05/msg00001.html","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-577017.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57256.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57256.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-57256","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/75471602a53215062ddbaeb95f039a60b664c3d0/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-57256.json","https://github.com/ocp-hm-openbmc-opf-ami/meta-ami/blob/5f689b55d58747fe911d565fdb321768aed35a0b/meta-common/recipes-bsp/u-boot/files/CVE-2024-57256.patch","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57256.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/d8c79a157e22e9abda84461cbe0f59ce58612245/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57256-2025-11-03-1351","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-57256.md","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2024-57256.html","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-57256-an-integer-overflow-in-ext4fs-read--1771412947000.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0594.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0593","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0593.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57255","title":"Das U-Boot SquashFS 整数溢出漏洞","description":"Das U-Boot 的 squashfs 文件系统解析函数 sqfs_resolve_symlink 中存在整数溢出漏洞（CWE-190）。当攻击者构造一个 inode 大小为 0xffffffff 的恶意 squashfs 镜像时，整数溢出导致 malloc(0) 分配零字节内存，进而引发内存越界写入，可能造成代码执行。该漏洞影响 Das U-Boot 2025.01-rc1 之前的所有版本，需物理接触或已获得系统访问权限的攻击者挂载特制 squashfs 文件系统触发，CVSS 评分 7.1，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57255"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-18T23:15:09Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:13:27Z","remediation":"立即将 Das U-Boot 升级至 v2025.01-rc1 及以上版本（上游修复 commit: 233945eba63e）。Debian 用户：Bullseye 升级至 2021.01+dfsg-5+deb11u3，Bookworm 升级至 2023.01+dfsg-2+deb12u3，Trixie/Sid 升级至 2025.01-3 及以上。如无法升级，避免加载或挂载来源不可信的 squashfs 镜像文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://source.denx.de/u-boot/u-boot/-/commit/233945eba63e24061dffeeaeb7cd6fe985278356","https://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/02/17/2","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/05/msg00001.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57255.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57255.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57255.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-57255","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/75471602a53215062ddbaeb95f039a60b664c3d0/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-57255.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/d8c79a157e22e9abda84461cbe0f59ce58612245/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57255-2025-11-03-1351","https://github.com/moyamartin/meta-rpi-mmoya/blob/503560d3dcf3bf87d8e93ed59f202e9120db397b/recipes-bsp/u-boot/files/CVE-2024-57255.patch","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-57255.md","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-57255-an-integer-overflow-in-sqfs-resolve-1771411771000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2025/02/GHSA-5cmq-wrwp-9x26/GHSA-5cmq-wrwp-9x26.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0593.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0592","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0592.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-57254","title":"DENX Das U-Boot squashfs 文件系统符号链接大小计算整数溢出漏洞","description":"Das U-Boot 引导加载程序中的 sqfs_inode_size 函数在处理 squashfs 文件系统时存在整数溢出漏洞，具体发生在符号链接大小计算过程中。攻击者通过物理方式访问目标设备并挂载特制的 squashfs 文件系统镜像，可触发该整数溢出，导致内存破坏，最终实现任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Das U-Boot 2025.01-rc1 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 7.1，危害等级高。由于需要物理访问且攻击复杂度较高，实际利用门槛较高，但仍对嵌入式设备和 IoT 系统构成严重安全威胁。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2024-57254"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-18T23:15:09Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:13:27Z","remediation":"升级 Das U-Boot 至 2025.01-rc1 或更高版本，该版本已修复 sqfs_inode_size 中符号链接大小计算的整数溢出问题。Debian 11 用户可安装 DLA-4150 安全更新（apt update && apt upgrade u-boot）。如无法立即升级，避免在 U-Boot 中加载或挂载来源不可信的 squashfs 镜像文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["https://source.denx.de/u-boot/u-boot/-/commit/c8e929e5758999933f9e905049ef2bf3fe6b140d","https://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/02/17/2","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/05/msg00001.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-57254.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57254.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2024/57xxx/CVE-2024-57254.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2024-57254","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/75471602a53215062ddbaeb95f039a60b664c3d0/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-57254.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/d8c79a157e22e9abda84461cbe0f59ce58612245/references/CveServices-CVE-2024-57254-2025-11-03-1351","https://github.com/moyamartin/meta-rpi-mmoya/blob/503560d3dcf3bf87d8e93ed59f202e9120db397b/recipes-bsp/u-boot/files/CVE-2024-57254.patch","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2024/CVE-2024-57254.md","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2024-57254-an-integer-overflow-in-sqfs-inode-s-1771411400000.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2025/02/GHSA-66gw-8528-j2rp/GHSA-66gw-8528-j2rp.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0592.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0563","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0563.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-56171","title":"libxml2 libxml2 释放后使用漏洞","description":"libxml2 在 2.12.10 之前版本及 2.13.x 至 2.13.5 版本的 xmlschemas.c 中 xmlSchemaIDCFillNodeTables 和 xmlSchemaBubbleIDCNodeTables 函数存在释放后使用漏洞（CWE-416）。攻击者需构造恶意 XML 文档并针对特定身份约束的 XML Schema 进行验证，或使用恶意 XML Schema，即可触发释放后使用导致内存损坏。该漏洞影响广泛使用 libxml2 的 XML 处理应用，CVSS 7.8（HIGH），攻击向量为本地、攻击复杂度高、无需权限与用户交互，成功利用可导致高机密性和完整性影响。修复版本为 2.12.10 及 2.13.6 及以上版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2024-56171"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-18T22:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T08:11:46Z","remediation":"立即更新 libxml2 到稳定版本 2.12.10 或更高版本（或 2.13.6），禁用 DTD 验证或加载特信任 XML 文档功能，如果无法立即打补丁，可在应用层面使用安全的 XML 解析器或限制外部实体处理，在使用 libxml2 的应用程序中添加 XML 文档长度验证措施作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/libxml2/-/issues/828","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2025/Apr/10","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2025/Apr/11","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2025/Apr/12","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2025/Apr/13","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2025/Apr/4","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2025/Apr/5","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2025/Apr/8","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2025/Apr/9","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/02/msg00028.html","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20250328-0010/","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2024/CVE-2024-56171.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1fee15e021f95477107e3e5d652470f76f7bac/cves/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56171.json","https://github.com/hashicorp/consul-k8s/blob/66f49d366dff263db55a96b45130d334d46f2da4/.changelog/4570.txt","https://github.com/sparklemotion/nokogiri/blob/80a20e46d767990d84e28a2b8e5c536022e222d1/CHANGELOG.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/75471602a53215062ddbaeb95f039a60b664c3d0/osv/cve/2024/UBUNTU-CVE-2024-56171.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/9ba62febaf6254d72eb4667cd7923d92d2c3f9b6/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2024-56171","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/dee3a736a4e988cc248dc4d7530452b86aa0546e/2024/56xxx/CVE-2024-56171.json","https://github.com/percona/percona-toolkit/blob/427b0d89dd2fe9c50278a2822af8cda5b01bea0e/docs/release_notes.rst","https://github.com/openshift/openshift-docs/blob/e9e1710ea99ad94cfc93205a40e9e2e099942d2c/modules/network-observability-operator-release-notes-1-8-1-cves.adoc","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/6ca8a69233790aa99633b6ad5606668ac000cf96/main/libxml2/APKBUILD"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2024/AVE-2024-0563.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2024-0523","file_name":"2024/AVE-2024-0523.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2024-45783","title":"GNU GRUB2 HFS+ 文件系统驱动空指针解引用漏洞","description":"GRUB2 的 HFS+ 文件系统驱动在处理挂载失败时未正确设置 ERRNO 值，导致引用计数（refcount）被重复递减两次，进而触发空指针访问。本地攻击者需具备高权限，通过挂载特制的恶意 HFS+ 文件系统即可触发此漏洞，造成系统崩溃或拒绝服务。该漏洞影响使用 GRUB2 引导程序的各类 Linux 发行版，CVSS 评分 4.4，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.4,"aliases":["CVE-2024-45783"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-18T20:15:19Z","updated":"2026-06-29T23:16:41Z","remediation":"升级 GRUB2 至修复版本：D